AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series — SNS & SQS🚀

Topic: Amazon SNS & Amazon SQS — Event-Driven and Messaging Services

As part of my AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series, today we’ll dive into two key AWS services that enable asynchronous communication between distributed systems — Amazon SNS (Simple Notification Service) and Amazon SQS (Simple Queue Service).

 Both play a critical role in decoupling microservices, improving reliability, and scaling event-driven architectures in DevOps environments.
Here are most-asked interview questions to help you master these services. 👇

